### 星途学堂核心模块接口示例（IDEA / VS Code REST Client 可直接执行）
@host = http://localhost:8081

### 1. 我的课表
GET {{host}}/api/learning/lessons?userId=1

### 2. 课表进度
GET {{host}}/api/learning/summary?userId=1

### 3. 上报学习进度（30 秒，未学完）
POST {{host}}/api/learning/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "lessonId": 1,
  "sectionId": 101,
  "sectionType": 1,
  "moment": 30,
  "finished": false
}

### 4. 同一小节再报（120 秒，学完）——Redis 中会合并成一条
POST {{host}}/api/learning/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "lessonId": 1,
  "sectionId": 101,
  "sectionType": 1,
  "moment": 120,
  "finished": true
}

### 5. 查看尚未落库的合并结果
GET {{host}}/api/learning/pending?lessonId=1

### 6. 已落库的学习记录
GET {{host}}/api/learning/records?userId=1&lessonId=1

### 7. 点赞
POST {{host}}/api/like
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "bizType": 1,
  "bizId": 1001
}

### 8. 取消点赞
DELETE {{host}}/api/like
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "bizType": 1,
  "bizId": 1001
}

### 9. 点赞数
GET {{host}}/api/like/count?bizType=1&bizId=1001

### 10. 手动同步点赞数据
POST {{host}}/api/like/sync

### 11. 签到
POST {{host}}/api/points/sign?userId=1

### 12. 排行榜
GET {{host}}/api/points/rank?topN=10

### 13. 领取优惠券（Lua 防超发）
POST {{host}}/api/coupon/1/receive?userId=1

### 14. 我的可用券
GET {{host}}/api/coupon/mine?userId=1

### 15. 计算最优优惠组合
POST {{host}}/api/coupon/best
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "orderAmount": 260
}
